        "created_at": "2025-08-10T16:23:22.264497+00:00",
        "notes": "For the first round we are going to want to take [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) as it allows the Clone to farm cash. The Clone was recently reworked to allow it to gain cash from Healing and Damage but it does less. This is still a considerable amount more cash than if it was just you alone. \n\nIt is imperative that you are using TP as soon as it is off Cooldown to farm the cash so you can get ahead of other players which is very much possible here. \n\nFor the items, we are going to pick up [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) as it gives us more active time on the clone and it allows it to do more Damage and Healing whilst it is active. \n\nFor the survival items, we are going to pick up [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) depending if you prefer Armour or Shields. \n\nFor the final item, we are going to buy [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) for the bonus Armour and Ability Power after using Kitsune Rush. This is just going to help us stay alive and keep the clone active.",
