        "notes": "For the Round 5 Power, you are going to want to get [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) as this allows you to farm Ultimate charge with your Suzu. \n\nFor the items for this round, we are going to want [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) as this gives us a Damage over Time effect. This effect is technically a negative effect and counts towards the bonus ultimate charge from [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68).\n\nThis allows you to get free Ultimate Charge everytime you cleanse yourself. It is also even better if your teammates also purchase this it counts it on teammates as a negative effect too.\n\nThere are a few blue items you can swap the green items for if you can afford them. This is very possible with this build.",
