        "created_at": "2025-08-10T16:23:22.264497+00:00",
        "notes": "For this round you can either purchase [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) to give Overhealth to teammates and yourself after a cleanse or [Goddess\u2019s Aura](item_a36d46c8-cee0-4c97-b6e4-72bb816c13dc) to give yourself Overhealth after you have TPed. \n\nI usually choose [Goddess\u2019s Aura](item_a36d46c8-cee0-4c97-b6e4-72bb816c13dc) as I can TP much more frequently than Suzu due to TP having a much shorter cooldown in this build. I find myself being borderline unkillable due to how fast you can TP around teammates and the amount of overhealth you gain. \n\nThis depends on whether your team are dying too quickly or you need extra survivability. I've added [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) into the build as its better for you team.",
